    "The client ID is an OAuth App identifier, not a secret. Create one at github.com/settings/developers (do not enable a client secret flow for a public device app) and paste its client ID here. The token it issues is stored in the Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The client ID is an OAuth App identifier, not a secret. Create one at github.com/settings/developers (do not enable a client secret flow for a public device app) and paste its client ID here. The token it issues is stored in the Keychain."
          }
        }
